{"step_index":196,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-19T16:44:43Z","content":"CRITICAL INSTRUCTION 1: I need to write a script to import the Excel data into the database. A Node.js script using `xlsx` and Prisma is the most direct approach.\nCRITICAL INSTRUCTION 2: I will use `write_to_file` to create the import script and then execute it via `run_command`.","thinking":"**Analyzing Agricultural Systems**\n\nOkay, I've confirmed the file lists Information Systems from the Department of Agriculture and Rural Development. I'm cross-referencing this with available documentation now. The data is a bit messy, so I'm working to organize and understand the scope of each system listed. I believe I can start categorizing them by function soon.\n\n\n**Mapping Data to Database**\n\nI'm now focusing on mapping the discovered data fields to the database schema. I've successfully identified the necessary fields from the provided list, such as the system name, domain, level, and management entity. My next step involves parsing the provided JSON, and integrating it into the `HeThongSo` table. I'm working now to accurately establish a mapping between the fields in the source data and the appropriate schema columns.\n\n\n**Refining Data Mapping**\n\nI'm making progress refining the data mapping. I've worked out the basic structure: `ten` maps to row[1], and `ma` is generated based on row[0]. I've also established the default `loai` as \"ung-dung\" (Lớp 3), but I'm checking for \"CSDL\" to map it to \"du-lieu\" (Lớp 2). I'm confident in accurately categorizing by function. I'm now implementing the logic for parsing and incorporating the JSON into the database.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"const XLSX = require(\"xlsx\");\nconst { PrismaClient } = require(\"@prisma/client\");\n\nconst prisma = new PrismaClient();\n\nasync function importExcel() {\n  const filePath = \"C:\\\\Delta Force\\\\v4. ten mien - snnmt - bo_sung_CSDL_theo_ND278_15.9.2026 (1).xlsx\";\n  console.log(\"Reading file:\", filePath);\n  \n  const workbook = XLSX.readFile(filePath);\n  const sheetName = workbook.SheetNames[0];\n  const sheet = workbook.Sheets[sheetName];\n  const rows = XLSX.utils.sheet_to_json(sheet, { header: 1 });\n\n  // Get or create the \"Sở Nông nghiệp và Môi trường\" unit\n  let donVi = await prisma.donVi.findFirst({\n    where: { ten: { contains: \"Sở Nông nghiệp\" } }\n  });\n\n  if (!donVi) {\n    const tinh = await prisma.donVi.findFirst({ where: { loai: \"tinh\" } });\n    donVi = await prisma.donVi.create({\n      data: {\n        ten: \"Sở Nông nghiệp và Phát triển nông thôn\",\n        loai: \"so\",\n        parentId: tinh ? tinh.id : null,\n      }\n    });\n    console.log(\"Created Đơn vị:\", donVi.ten);\n  } else {\n    console.log(\"Found Đơn vị:\", donVi.ten);\n  }\n\n  let successCount = 0;\n\n  for (let i = 1; i < rows.length; i++) {\n    const row = rows[i];\n    if (!row || !row[1]) continue; // Skip empty rows\n\n    const ten = String(row[1]).trim();\n    const ma = `SNN-${String(row[0] || i).padStart(2, \"0\")}`;\n    const tenMien = row[2] ? String(row[2]).trim() : \"\";\n    const donViQuanLy = row[4] ? String(row[4]).trim() : \"\";\n    const donViCon = row[5] ? String(row[5]).trim() : \"\";\n    \n    let chuQuan = donViQuanLy;\n    if (donViCon) chuQuan += ` - ${donViCon}`;\n\n    const rawTrangThai = String(row[9] || \"\").toLowerCase();\n    let trangThai = \"dang-van-hanh\";\n    if (rawTrangThai.includes(\"không\") || rawTrangThai.includes(\"dừng\")) {\n      trangThai = \"can-thay-the\";\n    }\n\n    const namStr = String(row[6] || \"\");\n    const namTrienKhai = parseInt(namStr) || null;\n\n    // Build moTa from domain and data sharing info\n    let moTaParts = [];\n    if (tenMien && tenMien !== \"Không có\") moTaParts.push(`Tên miền: ${tenMien}`);\n    if (row[13]) moTaParts.push(`Dữ liệu chia sẻ: ${String(row[13]).substring(0, 200)}...`);\n    if (row[14]) moTaParts.push(`Phạm vi: ${String(row[14]).substring(0, 200)}...`);\n\n    const isDuLieu = ten.toLowerCase().includes(\"csdl\") || ten.toLowerCase().includes(\"dữ liệu\");\n    const loai = isDuLieu ? \"du-lieu\" : \"ung-dung\";\n    const lop = isDuLieu ? 2 : 3;\n\n    try {\n      await prisma.heThongSo.create({\n        data: {\n          ma,\n          ten,\n          loai,\n          lop,\n          moTa: moTaParts.join(\"\\\\n\"),\n          chuQuan,\n          trangThai,\n          namTrienKhai,\n          donViId: donVi.id\n        }\n      });\n      successCount++;\n      console.log(`Imported: ${ma} - ${ten.substring(0, 30)}...`);\n    } catch (e) {\n      console.error(`Error importing row ${i}:`, e.message);\n    }\n  }\n\n  console.log(`\\\\n✅ Import completed: ${successCount} systems added.`);\n  await prisma.$disconnect();\n}\n\nimportExcel().catch(e => {\n  console.error(e);\n  process.exit(1);\n});\n","Description":"Script to import Excel systems into database","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Delta Force\\kts-vinhlong\\import_snn.js","toolAction":"Writing Excel import script","toolSummary":"Excel import script"}}]}
