{"step_index":220,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-20T02:43:26Z","thinking":"**Refactoring Tab Items**\n\nI've updated the `HienTrangPage` component to reflect the signature change in `<LopTab>`.  Specifically, I'm now passing `items={byLop(lop)}` to the component where `tabItems` was previously used, as the `<LopTab>` component expects a different format for the `items` prop now. This should ensure the correct data is rendered within the tabs.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"replace_file_content","args":{"AllowMultiple":false,"Description":"Update LopTab usage in tabItems","EndLine":143,"Instruction":"Pass items prop to LopTab","ReplacementContent":"  const tabItems = ([1, 2, 3, 4] as const).map((lop) => {\n    const items = byLop(lop);\n    const cfg = LOP_CONFIG[lop];\n    const count = items.length;\n    return {\n      key: String(lop),\n      label: (\n        <span className=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n          <span>{cfg.icon}</span>\n          <span>{cfg.shortLabel}</span>\n          <Badge count={count} style={{ backgroundColor: cfg.color }} />\n        </span>\n      ),\n      children: <LopTab lop={lop} items={items} />,\n    };\n  });","StartLine":119,"TargetContent":"  const tabItems = ([1, 2, 3, 4] as const).map((lop) => {\n    const cfg = LOP_CONFIG[lop];\n    const count = byLop(lop).length;\n    return {\n      key: String(lop),\n      label: (\n        <span className=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n          <span>{cfg.icon}</span>\n          <span>{cfg.shortLabel}</span>\n          <Badge count={count} style={{ backgroundColor: cfg.color }} />\n        </span>\n      ),\n      children: <LopTab lop={lop} />,\n    };\n  });","TargetFile":"C:\\Delta Force\\kts-vinhlong\\src\\app\\(portal)\\kts\\hien-trang\\page.tsx","toolAction":"Passing items prop to LopTab","toolSummary":"Update LopTab props"}}]}
